<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>侵权责任与权利界限</title>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 60px;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background-color: #fdfdfc;
    /* Simulate grid notebook paper */
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(#e6ebe9 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, #e6ebe9 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 24px 24px;
    font-family: 'Kaiti', 'STKaiti', 'KaiTi_GB2312', 'SimKai', serif;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center; /* Horizontally center content */
  }

  .mindmap {
    /* Use traditional vertical writing mode to match the layout intent perfectly */
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .mindmap ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row; /* Inline progression (top-to-bottom physically) */
    gap: 15px; /* Default gap between sibling nodes */
  }

  .mindmap > ul {
    gap: 0;
  }

  .mindmap li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column; /* Block progression (right-to-left physically) */
    align-items: center; /* Center nodes vertically relative to their children */
  }

  .node-text {
    padding: 2px 4px;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  /* Style for main headings and branch titles based on the image's teal ink */
  .text-teal {
    color: #2b7a78;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  /* Style for descriptive text based on the image's black ink */
  .text-black {
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  /* --- Connecting Lines Framework --- */

  ul.children {
    /* Vertical connecting bar */
    border-right: 2px solid #2b7a78;
    margin-right: 25px; /* Distance from parent text to vertical bar */
    padding-right: 25px; /* Distance from vertical bar to child text */
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Remove vertical bar if there is only one child, forming a straight line instead */
  ul.children:has(> li:only-child) {
    border-right: none;
  }

  /* Horizontal line drawing from the vertical bar towards the parent */
  ul.children::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -25px; /* Matches margin-right */
    width: 25px;
    border-top: 2px solid #2b7a78;
  }

  /* Horizontal lines drawing from each child towards the vertical bar */
  ul.children > li {
    position: relative;
    padding-right: 15px; /* Small gap before text begins */
  }

  ul.children > li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -25px;
    width: 40px; /* Covers ul padding-right (25px) + li padding-right (15px) */
    border-top: 2px solid #2b7a78;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="mindmap">
  <ul>
    <li>
      <span class="node-text text-teal" style="font-size: 26px;">侵权责任与权利界限</span>
      <ul class="children" style="gap: 80px;"> <!-- Larger gap for the two main branches -->

        <!-- Top Branch: 侵权责任 -->
        <li>
          <span class="node-text text-teal">侵权责任</span>
          <ul class="children" style="gap: 25px;">
            <li>
              <span class="node-text text-teal">承担原因</span>
              <ul class="children">
                <li><span class="node-text text-black">行为人侵害他人民事权益，应当依法承担侵权责任</span></li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="node-text text-teal">承担方式</span>
              <ul class="children">
                <!-- Using <br> to accurately replicate the manual column wrap in the original image -->
                <li><span class="node-text text-black">停止侵害、排除妨碍、消除危险、返还财产、恢复原状、赔偿损失、<br>赔礼道歉、消除影响、恢复名誉</span></li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="node-text text-teal">诉讼时效期间</span>
              <ul class="children">
                <li><span class="node-text text-black">三年</span></li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="node-text text-teal">特殊侵权行为</span>
              <ul class="children">
                <li><span class="node-text text-black">无过错侵权责任</span></li>
                <li><span class="node-text text-black">过错推定</span></li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="node-text text-teal">追究侵权责任的意义</span>
              <ul class="children">
                <li><span class="node-text text-black">旨在保障民事主体合法权利不受侵犯</span></li>
                <li><span class="node-text text-black">有助于平衡社会各方利益，促进社会和谐</span></li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>

        <!-- Bottom Branch: 权利界限 -->
        <li>
          <span class="node-text text-teal">权利界限</span>
          <ul class="children" style="gap: 25px;">
            <li>
              <span class="node-text text-teal">民事权利</span>
              <ul class="children">
                <li><span class="node-text text-black">以诽谤、诋毁、侮辱等方式损害对方利益的构成侵权。</span></li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="node-text text-teal">知识产权</span>
              <ul class="children">
                <li>
                  <span class="node-text text-black">
                    合理使用：特定情形下，不需著作权人同意，也不必支付使用费<br>
                    <span style="font-size: 0.8em; color: #555; display: inline-block; margin-top: 15px;">[注：须指明作者和作品出处]</span>
                  </span>
                </li>
                <li><span class="node-text text-black">法定许可使用：不需著作权人同意，但应支付使用费</span></li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="node-text text-teal">相邻关系</span>
              <ul class="children">
                <li>
                  <span class="node-text text-teal">含义</span>
                  <ul class="children">
                    <li><span class="node-text text-black">是对不动产所有权的限制或延伸</span></li>
                  </ul>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="node-text text-teal">要求</span>
                  <ul class="children">
                    <li><span class="node-text text-black">不动产的相邻权利人应当按照有利生产、方便生活、团结互助、公平合理<br>的原则，正确处理相邻关系</span></li>
                    <li><span class="node-text text-black">相邻关系一方在为自己便利行使权利时，应当照顾到相邻方的利益，尽<br>量避免对相邻的不动产权利人造成损害</span></li>
                  </ul>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>

      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

</body>
</html>
